---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Silver RPG Master — Ferramentas para suas sessões">
  <main class="landing">
    <header class="topbar shell">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Silver RPG Master, início">
        <span class="brand-mark">S.</span>
        <span>SILVER <span class="muted">/</span> RPG MASTER</span>
      </a>
      <a class="button" href="/entrar">Acessar sala <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero shell">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ferramentas de mesa · Em desenvolvimento</p>
        <h1>Menos abas.<br /><span>Mais jogo.</span></h1>
        <p class="intro">Um espaço de apoio para conduzir sessões de RPG: recursos dos personagens, trilha sonora compartilhada e apresentação de conteúdo em um só lugar.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/entrar">Entrar na plataforma <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/convite">Tenho um convite</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-aside" aria-label="Módulos da plataforma">
        <div class="aside-heading"><span class="eyebrow">01 — Mesa</span><span class="status-dot"></span></div>
        <div class="module-row"><span class="module-index">01</span><div><strong>Escudo do mestre</strong><small>Recursos visíveis e sincronizados</small></div><span class="module-arrow">↗</span></div>
        <div class="module-row"><span class="module-index">02</span><div><strong>Trilha sonora</strong><small>Uma reprodução, volume individual</small></div><span class="module-arrow">↗</span></div>
        <div class="module-row"><span class="module-index">03</span><div><strong>Compartilhamento</strong><small>Conteúdo visual dentro da sala</small></div><span class="module-arrow">↗</span></div>
        <div class="aside-foot"><span>VOZ NO DISCORD</span><span>SEM VTT COMPLETO</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="shell footer">
      <span>UM INSTRUMENTO PARA A MESA, NÃO UM SUBSTITUTO DELA.</span>
      <span>© SILVER RPG MASTER</span>
    </footer>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .landing { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .topbar { height: 82px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr; gap: clamp(48px, 9vw, 132px); align-items: center; flex: 1; padding-block: 100px 112px; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 590px; }
  h1 { margin: 22px 0 23px; font: 700 clamp(56px, 7.5vw, 96px)/.98 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.075em; }
  h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
  .intro { max-width: 480px; color: #aab4aa; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; margin-top: 35px; }
  .text-link { color: var(--accent-strong); font-size: 13px; border-bottom: 1px solid #60715b; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .hero-aside { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #151a16; padding: 22px 24px 16px; }
  .aside-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .status-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #9cad8d; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #9cad8d18; }
  .module-row { min-height: 83px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px 1fr 18px; gap: 12px; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #29312a; }
  .module-index, .module-arrow { color: #788579; font: 11px var(--mono); }
  .module-row strong { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .module-row small { display: block; margin-top: 6px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .module-arrow { color: var(--accent); font-size: 15px; }
  .aside-foot, .footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #758075; font: 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .aside-foot { padding-top: 18px; }
  .footer { padding-block: 22px 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .shell { width: min(100% - 36px, 560px); }
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 54px; padding-block: 72px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(58px, 16vw, 82px); }
    .intro { font-size: 15px; }
    .footer { gap: 12px; flex-direction: column; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; } }
</style>
